sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser
    participant Proxy as Vercel Proxy
    participant Hybrid as HybridPipeline
    participant Road as Road Pipeline
    participant Rail as Rail Pipeline
    participant Air as Air Pipeline
    participant Water as Water Pipeline
    participant Scorer

    Browser->>Proxy: POST /optimize
    Proxy->>Hybrid: Forward request
    par Parallel execution
        Hybrid->>Road: optimize
        Hybrid->>Rail: optimize
        Hybrid->>Air: optimize
        Hybrid->>Water: optimize
    end
    Road-->>Hybrid: road result
    Rail-->>Hybrid: rail result
    Hybrid->>Scorer: Normalize + score
    Scorer-->>Hybrid: Comparison JSON
    Hybrid-->>Proxy: Response
    Proxy-->>Browser: Render results
